flowchart TD
    Launch[LaunchCampaign inactive]
    Scan[CampaignScheduler]
    Visits[ITutorVisitReadPort]
    Disp[CampaignDispatcher]
    Invite[NpsInvite + token]
    Jobs[MessageJobs]
    Worker[OutboxProcessor]
    Public[Public NPS API]
    Report[NpsReport / ReturnFrequency]

    Launch --> Visits
    Visits --> Disp
    Scan --> Visits
    Scan --> Invite
    Invite --> Disp
    Disp --> Jobs
    Worker --> Jobs
    Public --> Invite
    Invite --> Report
